OL,3,GNEWSALand sold for UK's 'largest
OL,4,Aelectricity substation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 70 acres of land has been
OL,7,Fsold to the National Grid to create
OL,8,Fwhat is expected to be the largest
OL,9,Felectricity substation in the UK.
OL,11,FThe land, spanning 73.3 acres by the
OL,12,Fside of the River Tees near
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough, will be used to create a
OL,14,Fsite with an initial electrical
OL,15,Fcapacity of 1.44GW - enough to power a
OL,16,Fmillion homes simultaneously or the
OL,17,Famount created by a nuclear reactor -
OL,18,Fwith scope to expand to 3.2GW in the
OL,19,Ffuture.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
