OL,3,GNEWSALand sold for UK's 'largest
OL,4,Aelectricity substation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTees Valley Mayor Ben Houchen said the
OL,7,Fsubstation could be used to power
OL,8,Flarge-scale industrial or manufacturing
OL,9,Fprojects, as well as AI data centres.
OL,11,FHe said the substation would mean the
OL,12,Fregion "can finally compete for those
OL,13,Fprojects".
